                "value": "Front and southern end of the <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/French_Lick_Springs_Hotel\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:French Lick Springs Hotel\">French Lick Springs Hotel</a>, located at 8670 W. <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Indiana_State_Road_56\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:Indiana State Road 56\">State Road 56</a> in <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/French_Lick,_Indiana\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:French Lick, Indiana\">French Lick</a>, <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Indiana\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:Indiana\">Indiana</a>, <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/United_States\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:United States\">United States</a>.  Built in 1902 and since converted into a casino, it and the surrounding grounds are listed together on the <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/National_Register_of_Historic_Places\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:National Register of Historic Places\">National Register of Historic Places</a>.",
